sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor R as Rahim
  participant UI as UI (React)
  participant API as API (FastAPI)
  participant AG as Agent + LLM
  participant QTE as Optimizer
  participant POL as Policy engine
  participant LED as Ledger + Audit

  R->>UI: "Pay my £9,250 tuition, cheapest safe way"
  UI->>API: POST /api/chat (SSE)
  API->>AG: guardrails pass · tools for "payments" intent
  AG->>AG: get_obligations (T0) → invoice NBU-2026-8201
  AG->>QTE: propose_payment(£9,250, invoice)
  QTE->>QTE: reverse quote × 4 providers<br/>limits · corridor · deadline feasibility · rank
  QTE->>POL: best feasible option
  POL->>POL: balance · registry match · limits · risk score → T2
  POL->>LED: PendingAction + payload_hash + HMAC(token) · audit
  POL-->>AG: {executed: false, next_step: "user must confirm"}
  Note over AG,POL: token goes only to the UI card, never to the LLM
  AG-->>UI: explanation + quote table + confirmation card (token)
  R->>UI: reviews amount, rate, fee, landed cost, arrival → Confirm
  UI->>API: POST /actions/{id}/confirm (token, Idempotency-Key)
  API->>POL: verify token (single-use, 5 min, hash, HMAC) · re-evaluate policy
  POL->>LED: balanced journal entries · invoice paid · receipt RMI-… · audit
  LED-->>UI: SSE: pending → processing → settled
